[REQUIREMENT]
UID: AC-SSS001
TITLE: Accepted clearances shall drive the point-mass maneuver
STATEMENT: >>>
When the aircraft accepts a clearance that authorizes taxi, hold short, line up and wait, takeoff, landing, go-around, the option, touch-and-go, or stop-and-go, the point-mass model shall fly that maneuver and shall not begin it before acceptance. A request alone shall not move the aircraft. Acceptance is a taxi clearance whose position is unchanged until the next time step and whose later steps follow the taxi path to the hold-short point.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The maneuver and the clearance have to be the same story.
<<<
DAL: E
